msgid ""
msgstr "If any sentence is too difficult to translate, keep the original Chinese as-is."

msgid "昇腾与GPU的开发差异"
msgstr "Development Differences Between Ascend and GPU"

msgid "多核任务并行策略"
msgstr "Multi-core Task Parallelization Strategy"

msgid "NPU在Triton多核并行中是物理核强绑定模式，与GPU逻辑维度并行+硬件自动物理映射的模式形成核心差异，核心对比如下表所示："
msgstr "In Triton multi-core parallelism, the NPU uses a physical core hard-binding mode, which forms a core difference from the GPU's logical dimension parallelism plus hardware automatic physical mapping mode. The core comparison is shown in the table below:"

msgid "维度"
msgstr "Dimension"

msgid "GPU（NVIDIA）"
msgstr "GPU (NVIDIA)"

msgid "昇腾（Ascend）"
msgstr "Ascend"

msgid "grid 本质"
msgstr "The essence of grid"

msgid "逻辑任务维度（和物理核解耦）"
msgstr "Logical task dimension (decoupled from physical cores)"

msgid "物理核组映射（绑定 AI Core 拓扑）"
msgstr "Physical Core Group Mapping (Binding AI Core Topology)"

msgid "核数 / 维度限制"
msgstr "Core Count / Dimension Limit"

msgid "grid 维度 / 大小无硬限制"
msgstr "grid dimensions / size have no hard limits"

msgid "grid 大小≤AI Core 总数，2D 需匹配拓扑"
msgstr "grid size ≤ total number of AI Cores, 2D must match topology"

msgid "GPU可绑定多个维度轴（三维grid=[n,m,l] 等同于乘积n×m×l个并行线程），每个线程仅对应一次kernel执行，且仅执行一次。 NPU的Vector核、Cube核属于多个物理核，不同代际硬件核数不同，每个核仅执行一次Block,且支持对该Block重复调度执行。"
msgstr "GPU can bind multiple dimension axes (a three-dimensional grid=[n,m,l] is equivalent to n×m×l parallel threads), with each thread corresponding to only one kernel execution, and it executes only once. The Vector core and Cube core of the NPU are multiple physical cores, with different numbers of cores across hardware generations. Each core executes a Block only once and supports repeated scheduling and execution of that Block."

msgid "充分利用核数"
msgstr "Fully utilize the number of cores"

msgid "昇腾NPU具备多个计算核心，合理分配并充分利用所有可用核心，是提升算子性能的关键因素之一。 在调用Triton内核函数时，通过设置launch参数控制使用的核数量。以GELU算子为例："
msgstr "Ascend NPU has multiple computing cores. Reasonably allocating and fully utilizing all available cores is one of the key factors in improving operator performance. When calling the Triton kernel function, the number of cores used is controlled by setting the launch parameters. Taking the GELU operator as an example:"

msgid "通过对核数的调优，可实现对所有计算资源的充分调度和利用，从而最大化并行度与吞吐量。未启用 `auto-blockify`（见下节）时，发射 grid 的核数需小于等于 65,535。"
msgstr "By tuning the number of cores, full scheduling and utilization of all computing resources can be achieved, thereby maximizing parallelism and throughput. When `auto-blockify` (see next section) is not enabled, the number of cores in the launched grid must be less than or equal to 65,535."

msgid "auto-blockify：突破 65,535 逻辑块上限"
msgstr "auto-blockify: breaking the 65,535 logical block limit"

msgid "社区 Triton 在 NVIDIA GPU 上把 grid 视为纯逻辑维度 —— `n` 个逻辑块按 1:1 映射到 `n` 个硬件块，运行时由硬件分发到各 SM，每个块不需要内部循环。昇腾上由于上节描述的物理核强绑定，可启动的 grid 上限被卡在 65,535，对含百万级逻辑工作项的 kernel（autotune 后的 reduce/scan、megablocks 风格的稀疏 kernel 等）过于严苛。"
msgstr "Community Triton treats the grid as a purely logical dimension on NVIDIA GPUs — `n` logical blocks are mapped 1:1 to `n` hardware blocks, distributed to SMs by the hardware at runtime, with no internal loop required per block. On Ascend, due to the strong physical core binding described in the previous section, the upper limit of launchable grids is capped at 65,535, which is too restrictive for kernels with millions of logical work items (such as autotuned reduce/scan, megablocks-style sparse kernels, etc.)."

msgid "`auto-blockify`（`SIMTAutoBlockify` 编译期 pass + 配套的运行期 cap）通过\"编译期视为逻辑、启动期折叠到物理核\"消除该限制："
msgstr "`auto-blockify` (`SIMTAutoBlockify` compile-time pass + corresponding runtime cap) eliminates this limitation by \"treating it as logical at compile time and folding it into physical cores at startup.\""

msgid "**编译期**：Triton pass 把 kernel 函数体包进一层 `scf.for`，迭代变量由 `gpu.linear_block_id` 提供。chunk 大小 = `ceildiv(logical_block_count, physical_core_count)`，每个物理块依次跑 `chunk` 个逻辑 block id。"
msgstr "**Compile time**: The Triton pass wraps the kernel function body into a layer of `scf.for`, with the iteration variable provided by `gpu.linear_block_id`. Chunk size = `ceildiv(logical_block_count, physical_core_count)`, each physical block sequentially runs `chunk` logical block IDs."

msgid "**运行期**：传给 launcher 的 block-count 参数从逻辑 grid clamp 到 `physical_core_count`，与编译期的折叠保持一致。"
msgstr "**Runtime**: The `block-count` parameter passed to the launcher is logically grid clamped to `physical_core_count`, consistent with compile-time folding."

msgid "两侧共享同一份 gating 元数据（`NPUOptions` 上的 `enable_auto_blockify`，未传时回落到 `TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL`），编译期循环包与运行期 cap 永远同步 —— 不存在 kernel 按一种模式编译却按另一种模式启动的情形。"
msgstr "Both sides share the same gating metadata (`enable_auto_blockify` on `NPUOptions`, falling back to `TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL` when not passed). The compile-time loop wrapping and the runtime cap are always synchronized — there is no scenario where a kernel is compiled under one mode but launched under another."

msgid "从 GPU Triton kernel 移植时的注意事项："
msgstr "Notes for porting from GPU Triton kernel:"

msgid "grid 大于 65,535 可直接运行，无需手动把外层维度折叠进 kernel 函数体。"
msgstr "If the grid is greater than 65,535, it can be run directly without manually folding the outer dimensions into the kernel function body."

msgid "逻辑块之间必须保持顺序无关（循环按 chunk 顺序访问）。依赖严格逻辑 block id 顺序的 kernel（如基于特定顺序的跨块同步）需要改写。"
msgstr "Logical blocks must maintain order independence (loops access chunks in order). Kernels that rely on strict logical block ID order (such as cross-block synchronization based on a specific order) need to be rewritten."

msgid "per-block workspace 分配从 `O(logical_block_count)` 降到 `O(physical_core_count)`，因为 workspace 在内层 `scf.for` 各次迭代间复用。"
msgstr "per-block workspace allocation reduces from `O(logical_block_count)` to `O(physical_core_count)` because the workspace is reused across iterations of the inner `scf.for` loop."

msgid "单核数据搬运策略"
msgstr "Single-core data migration strategy"

msgid "数据切分Tiling"
msgstr "Data Tiling"

msgid "写Triton内核函数时，合理的数据切分策略对性能优化至关重要。通过调整不同的切分粒度参数，可以在不同维度上平衡计算负载与内存访问效率。"
msgstr "When writing Triton kernel functions, a reasonable data partitioning strategy is crucial for performance optimization. By adjusting different partitioning granularity parameters, the computational load and memory access efficiency can be balanced across various dimensions."

msgid "常见的切分参数包括："
msgstr "Common segmentation parameters include:"

msgid "开发者可根据实际场景手动选择最优的切分配置，使得每次计算尽可能充分利用片上内存（On-chip Memory），避免频繁访问全局内存（Global Memory）造成的 性能瓶颈。"
msgstr "Developers can manually select the optimal partitioning configuration based on the actual scenario to maximize the utilization of on-chip memory for each computation, avoiding performance bottlenecks caused by frequent access to global memory."

msgid "以GELU算子为例，通过调整切分参数，可以有效适配片上缓存容量限制，从而提升执行效率。"
msgstr "Taking the GELU operator as an example, by adjusting the tiling parameters, it can effectively adapt to the on-chip cache capacity constraints, thereby improving execution efficiency."

msgid "注：Atlas 800T/I A2产品的片上内存容量为192KB，因此在设计切分策略时需考虑该限制，确保每轮计算的数据量不超过片上内存容量。"
msgstr "Note: The on-chip memory capacity of the Atlas 800T/I A2 product is 192KB. Therefore, this limitation must be considered when designing the partitioning strategy to ensure that the data volume per computation round does not exceed the on-chip memory capacity."

msgid "GELU算子示例"
msgstr "GELU Operator Example"

msgid "GELU算子开发示例，使用3种方式计算结果。"
msgstr "GELU Operator Development Example, Using Three Methods to Compute Results."

msgid "standard_unary      为标准Torch计算。"
msgstr "standard_unary is for standard Torch computation."

msgid "triton_easy_kernel  为简单Triton实现。"
msgstr "triton_easy_kernel is a simple Triton implementation."

msgid "triton_better_kernel为更高效的Triton实现。"
msgstr "triton_better_kernel is a more efficient implementation of Triton."

msgid "标准Torch写法"
msgstr "Standard Torch implementation"

msgid "输入tensor x0，经过torch计算实现 GELU 算子，返回结果值。"
msgstr "Input tensor x0, compute the GELU operator via torch, and return the result value."

msgid "简单Triton写法"
msgstr "Simple Triton Implementation"

msgid "以下是一个使用 Triton 编写的简单内核示例，用于展示如何定义和调用一个基本的Triton内核函数。此示例实现了一个简单的数学运算（GELU 激活函数）。"
msgstr "Below is a simple kernel example written in Triton, demonstrating how to define and call a basic Triton kernel function. This example implements a simple mathematical operation (the GELU activation function)."

msgid "注意事项"
msgstr "Precautions"

msgid "内存限制：上述写法中，所有输入数据一次性被加载到内存中进行计算。如果输入张量过大，可能会超出单个内核的片上内存容量，导致内存溢出错误。 因此，这种简单的写法更适合于小规模张量的计算或用于理解 Triton 内核的基本写法和调用方式。"
msgstr "Memory Limitation: In the above approach, all input data is loaded into memory at once for computation. If the input tensor is too large, it may exceed the on-chip memory capacity of a single kernel, leading to out-of-memory errors. Therefore, this simple approach is more suitable for small-scale tensor computations or for understanding the basic syntax and invocation methods of Triton kernels."

msgid "适用场景：尽管这种方法有助于快速理解和入门 Triton 编程，但对于大规模数据集或高性能要求的应用场景，建议采用更复杂的数据切分策略（如 Tiling）， 以充分利用硬件资源并避免内存溢出问题。通过这种方式，开发者可以快速上手 Triton 编程，同时了解如何定义、调用以及优化 Triton 内核函数。"
msgstr "Applicable scenarios: Although this approach helps quickly understand and get started with Triton programming, for large-scale datasets or high-performance application scenarios, it is recommended to adopt more complex data partitioning strategies (such as Tiling) to fully utilize hardware resources and avoid memory overflow issues. In this way, developers can quickly get started with Triton programming while learning how to define, call, and optimize Triton kernel functions."

msgid "更高效triton写法"
msgstr "More efficient triton writing"

msgid "在昇腾 NPU 上使用 Triton 编写高性能算子时，为了充分利用硬件资源、避免内存溢出并提升执行效率，通常需要采用数据切分（Tiling）策略。 下面是一个经过优化的 Triton 内核实现示例，适用于大规模张量计算。"
msgstr "When using Triton to write high-performance operators on Ascend NPU, a data tiling strategy is typically required to fully utilize hardware resources, avoid memory overflow, and improve execution efficiency. Below is an example of an optimized Triton kernel implementation suitable for large-scale tensor computations."

msgid "关键代码解释"
msgstr "Key Code Explanation"

msgid "编译优化能力"
msgstr "Compilation optimization capability"

msgid "AscendNPU IR优化"
msgstr "AscendNPU IR Optimization"

msgid "针对昇腾软硬件特性，适配了AscendNPU IR优化的编译选项，如下表所示。 **使用方法**：在autotune的配置阶段，传入编译选项的值 以开启`multibuffer`选项举例，在autotune的配置阶段，即`triton.Config`中，传入`'multibuffer': True`，详见[autotune示例](../examples/06_autotune_example.md)："
msgstr "For the features of Ascend hardware and software, the compilation options for AscendNPU IR optimization have been adapted, as shown in the table below. **Usage**: During the autotune configuration phase, pass the value of the compilation option. For example, to enable the `multibuffer` option, pass `'multibuffer': True` in the autotune configuration phase, i.e., in `triton.Config`. See the [autotune example](../examples/06_autotune_example.md) for details."

msgid "选项"
msgstr "Options"

msgid "能力"
msgstr "Capability"

msgid "是否开启"
msgstr "Whether to enable"

msgid "multibuffer"
msgstr "multibuffer"

msgid "开启流水并行数据搬运"
msgstr "Enable pipeline parallel data transfer."

msgid "默认true； true , false。 autotune中可配置"
msgstr "Default is true; true, false. Configurable in autotune."

msgid "unit_flag"
msgstr "unit_flag"

msgid "cube搬出的一个优化项"
msgstr "An optimization item extracted from cube"

msgid "默认None；true , false。  autotune中可配置"
msgstr "Default is None; true, false. Configurable in autotune."

msgid "limit_auto_multi_buffer_only_for_local_buffer"
msgstr "limit_auto_multi_buffer_only_for_local_buffer"

msgid "CV算子一个优化项，cube搬出的一个优化项"
msgstr "An optimization item for the CV operator, an optimization item for cube offloading."

msgid "默认None；true , false。 autotune中可配置"
msgstr "Default is None; true, false. Configurable in autotune."

msgid "limit_auto_multi_buffer_of_local_buffer"
msgstr "limit_auto_multi_buffer_of_local_buffer"

msgid "cube算子开启double buffer具体的scope"
msgstr "The specific scope for enabling double buffer in the cube operator"

msgid "默认None；可取值 \"no-limit\" 或 \"no-l0c\"，autotune中可配置"
msgstr "Default is None; possible values are \"no-limit\" or \"no-l0c\", configurable in autotune."

msgid "set_workspace_multibuffer"
msgstr "set_workspace_multibuffer"

msgid "配置 workspace multi-buffer 档位，用于为 workspace 相关数据搬运启用多缓冲。"
msgstr "Configure the workspace multi-buffer level to enable multi-buffering for workspace-related data transfers."

msgid "默认None；可取单个值，如 2 或 4；autotune中可配置候选值"
msgstr "Default is None; a single value can be taken, such as 2 or 4; candidate values can be configured in autotune."

msgid "enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance"
msgstr "enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance"

msgid "启用或禁用自动 CV balance，用于在 CV 融合场景下平衡 Cube 与 Vector 执行。"
msgstr "Enable or disable automatic CV balance, used to balance Cube and Vector execution in CV fusion scenarios."

msgid "tile_mix_vector_loop"
msgstr "tile_mix_vector_loop"

msgid "CV算子的一个优化项，当前vector可以切几份"
msgstr "An optimization item for the CV operator, the current vector can be split into several parts."

msgid "默认None；可取单个值，如 2、4 或 8；autotune中可配置候选值"
msgstr "Default is None; a single value can be taken, such as 2, 4, or 8; candidate values can be configured in autotune."

msgid "tile_mix_cube_loop"
msgstr "tile_mix_cube_loop"

msgid "CV算子一个优化项，当前cube可以切几份"
msgstr "An optimization item for the CV operator, how many parts the current cube can be divided into."

msgid "auto_blockify_size"
msgstr "auto_blockify_size"

msgid "TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL优化项，用于指定扩展的左起第一个维度的大小。"
msgstr "TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL optimization option, used to specify the size of the first dimension expanded from the left."

msgid "默认1；可取单个整数值，如 2、4 或 8；autotune中可配置候选值"
msgstr "Default is 1; a single integer value can be taken, such as 2, 4, or 8; candidate values can be configured in autotune."

msgid "enable_auto_blockify"
msgstr "enable_auto_blockify"

msgid "per-kernel 级别覆盖 `TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL` 环境变量。显式设为 **true** 或 **false** 时，kernel 按该值生效（忽略环境变量）；未设置（None）时由环境变量决定。优先级：该选项 > 环境变量 > 关。编译期 blockify pass 与运行期 block-count cap 都按此解析后的值生效，二者永远一致。"
msgstr "Per-kernel level overrides the `TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL` environment variable. When explicitly set to **true** or **false**, the kernel takes effect according to that value (ignoring the environment variable); when unset (None), it is determined by the environment variable. Priority: this option > environment variable > off. Both the compile-time blockify pass and the runtime block-count cap take effect according to this resolved value, and they are always consistent."

msgid "默认 None；可取值 **true** / **false** / None。"
msgstr "Default is None; possible values are **true** / **false** / None."

msgid "注：优化编译选项在ascend/backend/compiler.py代码中。"
msgstr "Note: The optimization compilation options are in the `ascend/backend/compiler.py` code."

msgid "注：CV算子表示该算子运算过程中既使用了AI Core又使用了Vector Core。"
msgstr "Note: The CV operator indicates that the operator uses both AI Core and Vector Core during its computation."

msgid "Triton-Ascend算子迁移"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend Operator Migration"

msgid "概述：本文档介绍将 GPU Triton 算子迁移到昇腾 NPU 平台的相关内容，包括架构差异分析和具体迁移步骤。"
msgstr "Overview: This document describes the migration of GPU Triton operators to the Ascend NPU platform, including architecture difference analysis and specific migration steps."

msgid "文档组织"
msgstr "Document Organization"

msgid "[架构差异分析](./architecture_difference.md) — GPU与NPU平台的架构差异"
msgstr "[Architecture Difference Analysis](./architecture_difference.md) — Architecture differences between GPU and NPU platforms"

msgid "[GPU Triton算子迁移](./migrate_from_gpu.md) — 详细的迁移步骤和常见问题"
msgstr "[GPU Triton Operator Migration](./migrate_from_gpu.md) — Detailed migration steps and common issues"

msgid "GPU Triton算子迁移"
msgstr "GPU Triton Operator Migration"

msgid "概述：本文介绍 GPU Triton 算子迁移到昇腾 NPU 时的通用处理思路和常见问题。迁移时建议先完成 Python 侧设备与运行时接口替换，再检查 grid 分核、访存对齐、单核计算、UB 空间和 coreDim 限制，最后结合具体示例完成代码修改和正确性验证。"
msgstr "Overview: This document introduces the general approach and common issues when migrating GPU Triton operators to Ascend NPU. During migration, it is recommended to first complete the replacement of device and runtime interfaces on the Python side, then check grid partitioning, memory access alignment, single-core computation, UB space, and coreDim constraints, and finally complete code modification and correctness verification with specific examples."

msgid "通用迁移流程"
msgstr "General Migration Process"

msgid "迁移 Python 侧设备和运行时接口"
msgstr "Migrating Python-side device and runtime interfaces"

msgid "在修改具体 Triton kernel 前，先完成 Python 侧设备迁移："
msgstr "Before modifying the specific Triton kernel, first complete the Python-side device migration."

msgid "在 Python 文件中增加 `import torch_npu`。"
msgstr "Add `import torch_npu` in the Python file."

msgid "查找 `device=\"cuda\"`、`device='cuda'`、`.cuda()` 和 `.to(\"cuda\")` 等设备指定方式，改为 `device=\"npu\"`、`device='npu'`、`.npu()` 或 `.to(\"npu\")`。"
msgstr "Search for device specifications such as `device=\"cuda\"`, `device='cuda'`, `.cuda()`, and `.to(\"cuda\")`, and change them to `device=\"npu\"`, `device='npu'`, `.npu()`, or `.to(\"npu\")`."

msgid "查找 `torch.cuda.*`、CUDA stream、CUDA event、CUDA synchronize 等 GPU 专属接口，改为 NPU 对应接口或删除不必要的同步逻辑。"
msgstr "Find GPU-specific interfaces such as `torch.cuda.*`, CUDA stream, CUDA event, CUDA synchronize, and replace them with NPU corresponding interfaces or remove unnecessary synchronization logic."

msgid "删除只为 GPU 设备发现服务的逻辑，例如 `triton.runtime.driver.active.get_active_torch_device()` 相关设备断言。"
msgstr "Remove logic that only serves GPU device discovery, such as device assertions related to `triton.runtime.driver.active.get_active_torch_device()`."

msgid "保持 Triton kernel 主体逻辑不变，先用 NPU Tensor 完成编译和正确性验证。"
msgstr "Keep the main logic of the Triton kernel unchanged, first use NPU Tensor to complete compilation and correctness verification."

msgid "调整 grid 分核"
msgstr "Adjust grid partitioning"

msgid "GPU 上常见的写法会把 grid 设计为大量逻辑 program，由硬件和运行时调度到 SM 上执行。迁移到 NPU 时，应优先考虑物理 AI Core 数量和算子类型："
msgstr "A common approach on GPU is to design the grid as a large number of logical programs, which are scheduled by hardware and runtime to execute on SMs. When migrating to NPU, priority should be given to the physical number of AI Cores and the operator type."

msgid "grid 优先使用 1D；2D NPU 适配写法也会合并为 1D，例如 `(20,)` 与 `(4, 5)` 的效果相同。"
msgstr "grid prioritizes 1D; 2D NPU adaptation syntax will also be merged into 1D, for example, `(20,)` has the same effect as `(4, 5)`."

msgid "Vector-only 算子的并发任务数通常按 Vector Core 数量组织；包含 `tl.dot` 的算子通常按 AI Core 数量组织。"
msgstr "The number of concurrent tasks for vector-only operators is typically organized based on the number of Vector Cores; operators that include `tl.dot` are usually organized based on the number of AI Cores."

msgid "当逻辑 grid 远大于物理核数时，需要评估是否改成每个 program 内部循环处理多个 tile，或在逻辑核之间无顺序依赖时使用 `TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL`。"
msgstr "When the logical grid is much larger than the number of physical cores, it is necessary to evaluate whether to modify each program to process multiple tiles in an inner loop, or to use `TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL` when there is no sequential dependency between logical cores."

msgid "coreDim 不能超过 `UINT16_MAX`（65535），大 shape 算子需要结合 BLOCK_SIZE 或分块方式控制 grid 大小。"
msgstr "coreDim cannot exceed `UINT16_MAX` (65535). For large shape operators, the grid size needs to be controlled in combination with BLOCK_SIZE or a tiling approach."

msgid "核心结构"
msgstr "Core Structure"

msgid "算子类型"
msgstr "Operator Type"

msgid "昇腾 NPU (Ascend)"
msgstr "Ascend NPU"

msgid "多个 AI Core，分为 Cube Core（矩阵乘）和 Vector Core（向量计算）"
msgstr "Multiple AI Cores, divided into Cube Core (matrix multiplication) and Vector Core (vector computation)."

msgid "Vector-only 算子 → 并发任务数 = Vector Core 数；含 `tl.dot` 算子 → 并发任务数 = AI Core 数"
msgstr "Vector-only operator → number of concurrent tasks = number of Vector Cores; operator containing `tl.dot` → number of concurrent tasks = number of AI Cores"

msgid "GPU NVIDIA/AMD"
msgstr "NVIDIA/AMD GPU"

msgid "多个 CUDA Core（标量/向量计算） + Tensor Core（矩阵乘）"
msgstr "Multiple CUDA Cores (scalar/vector computation) + Tensor Cores (matrix multiplication)"

msgid "GPU 算子一般由编译器和硬件自动决定并发度"
msgstr "GPU operators generally have their concurrency automatically determined by the compiler and hardware."

msgid "检查单核数据搬运"
msgstr "Check single-core data transfer"

msgid "完成设备替换后，需要继续检查单个 program 内的数据搬运方式："
msgstr "After completing the device replacement, it is necessary to continue checking the data transfer method within a single program."

msgid "Vector 算子场景下要求 32 字节访存对齐，cube-vector 融合算子场景下要求 512 字节对齐。"
msgstr "In the Vector operator scenario, 32-byte memory access alignment is required, while in the cube-vector fusion operator scenario, 512-byte alignment is required."

msgid "保留 tail mask，确认边界元素不会越界访问。"
msgstr "Keep the tail mask to ensure that boundary elements do not access out-of-bounds."

msgid "检查一次 tile 的片上内存占用，避免触发 UB 空间溢出。"
msgstr "Check the on-chip memory usage of a tile at a time to avoid triggering UB space overflow."

msgid "移除或替换 GPU 专属同步 API，例如 CUDA thread、stream、event 或 kernel synchronize 相关接口。"
msgstr "Remove or replace GPU-specific synchronization APIs, such as CUDA thread, stream, event, or kernel synchronize related interfaces."

msgid "检查单核数据运算"
msgstr "Check single-core data computation"

msgid "NPU 与 GPU 的计算单元和支持的数据类型存在差异。迁移后应先保证正确性，再根据性能问题调整："
msgstr "There are differences in the compute units and supported data types between NPUs and GPUs. After migration, correctness should be ensured first, and then adjustments should be made based on performance issues."

msgid "对整数索引、offset、长度等中间值，优先确认当前数据类型是否被 NPU 路径高效支持。"
msgstr "For intermediate values such as integer indices, offsets, and lengths, first confirm whether the current data type is efficiently supported by the NPU path."

msgid "对含 `tl.dot` 的算子，确认 M/N/K tile、累加 dtype 和输出 dtype 是否符合 NPU 后端要求。"
msgstr "For operators containing `tl.dot`, confirm whether the M/N/K tile, accumulation dtype, and output dtype meet the NPU backend requirements."

msgid "对长序列、长 hidden size 或大 K 维循环，优先通过 tiling 控制单次搬入和计算规模。"
msgstr "For long sequences, large hidden sizes, or large K-dimensional loops, prioritize controlling the single-load and computation scale through tiling."

