msgstr "Migration Example"

msgid "示例 1：向量加法完整迁移"
msgstr "Example 1: Complete Migration of Vector Addition"

msgid "示例 2：设备替换与单核数据搬运"
msgstr "Example 2: Device Replacement and Single-Core Data Transfer"

msgid "以下示例展示将设备从 CUDA 替换为 NPU 后，对单核数据搬运场景进行正确性验证："
msgstr "The following example demonstrates correctness verification for a single-core data transfer scenario after replacing the device from CUDA to NPU:"

msgid "常见问题概览"
msgstr "Common Issues Overview"

msgid "完成迁移基础步骤后，可能会遇到新的问题，新问题可归纳为以下两类："
msgstr "After completing the basic migration steps, new issues may arise, which can be categorized into the following two types:"

msgid "coreDim 限制问题"
msgstr "coreDim limitation issue"

msgid "当网格维度超过NPU硬件限制时触发。 典型错误信息：`coreDim=xxxx can't be greater than UINT16_MAX`。"
msgstr "Triggered when the grid dimension exceeds NPU hardware limits. Typical error message: `coreDim=xxxx can't be greater than UINT16_MAX`."

msgid "UB 空间溢出"
msgstr "UB stack overflow"

msgid "内存使用超出NPU缓存容量。 典型错误信息：`ub overflow, requires xxxx bits while 1572864 bits available!`。"
msgstr "Memory usage exceeds NPU cache capacity. Typical error message: `ub overflow, requires xxxx bits while 1572864 bits available!`."

msgid "解决 coreDim 超限问题"
msgstr "Resolving the coreDim exceeding limit issue"

msgid "问题分析: NPU的 coreDim 参数不能超过 UINT16_MAX（65535）。当处理大规模数据时，简单的grid划分可能导致该限制被突破。"
msgstr "Problem Analysis: The `coreDim` parameter of the NPU cannot exceed UINT16_MAX (65535). When processing large-scale data, simple grid partitioning may cause this limit to be exceeded."

msgid "案例：zeros_like 函数优化 数据规模：N = 1073741824，原始 BLOCK_SIZE = 2048，计算得到的 coreDim = 524288 > 65535（超限）"
msgstr "Case: Optimization of zeros_like function. Data size: N = 1073741824, original BLOCK_SIZE = 2048, calculated coreDim = 524288 > 65535 (exceeds limit)."

